{"4078140": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Forward Vector", "steam_appid": 4078140, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The demo contains the first level, a secret for the bravest players and the alpha in-game level editor. </i>   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into <strong>Forward Vector</strong>, a relentless 3D auto-runner platformer in first-person view.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sharpen your reflexes by  performing flawless jumps, dives, and slides, and master aerial control to complete unforgiving levels set to intense electronic tracks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the old school difficulty of <strong>classic 2D auto-scroller</strong> is your thing, you'll be served, as <strong>Forward Vector</strong> brings the essentials of this genre with a new <strong>3D first person perspective</strong> and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 <strong>tough</strong> but <strong>fairly</strong> design levels. <i>And more levels are planned coming in future updates.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Satisfying</strong> first-person controls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An advanced <strong>3D level editor</strong>. To create and share levels with the community!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collectibles</strong> and unlockable <strong>secrets</strong>!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique synchronized <strong>Intense electronics soundtracks!</strong> Bouncing your head throughout your runs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Abstract futuristic environments.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The demo contains the first level, a secret for the bravest players and the alpha in-game level editor. </i>   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into <strong>Forward Vector</strong>, a relentless 3D auto-runner platformer in first-person view.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sharpen your reflexes by  performing flawless jumps, dives, and slides, and master aerial control to complete unforgiving levels set to intense electronic tracks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the old school difficulty of <strong>classic 2D auto-scroller</strong> is your thing, you'll be served, as <strong>Forward Vector</strong> brings the essentials of this genre with a new <strong>3D first person perspective</strong> and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 <strong>tough</strong> but <strong>fairly</strong> design levels. <i>And more levels are planned coming in future updates.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Satisfying</strong> first-person controls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An advanced <strong>3D level editor</strong>. To create and share levels with the community!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collectibles</strong> and unlockable <strong>secrets</strong>!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique synchronized <strong>Intense electronics soundtracks!</strong> Bouncing your head throughout your runs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Abstract futuristic environments.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Push your limits in Forward Vector's 3D parkour! Perform flawless jumps and slides and master aerial control with satisfying first-person movement, on the beat of intense electronic tracks. No mistakes allowed, perfection is key. Can you achieve it?", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078140/f1288c840882d7261bf39dfce83864632dc00a40/header.jpg?t=1781445989", "capsule_im